{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫選秀節目《聲夢傳奇》出身的小花向來人氣高企，私底下的動態亦備受關注。近日兩位人氣成員鍾柔美（Yumi）與炎明熹（Gigi）便先後在社交平台分享生活點滴。鍾柔美趁好天氣出海玩Wakesurf大派福利，炎明熹則孖住新歌MV男主角大玩不露齒挑戰，全程笑料百出。</p><figure><img alt=\"決賽後姚焯菲與炎明熹、鍾柔美一起出席首個商業宣傳。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210914/514275886187417600789561.jpeg/98TRNOeId1HEV3Ns_V14FYhrF4aEWFoDBxDRTwcQ0U8\"/><figcaption>決賽後姚焯菲與炎明熹、鍾柔美一起出席首個商業宣傳。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"炎明熹、鍾柔美、姚卓菲。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210812/502508269156700160732409.jpeg/jOjyHaqypTPlLMH_elxV74bemY7Ix7wdF0I7nxdCO58\"/><figcaption>炎明熹、鍾柔美、姚卓菲。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>鍾柔美出海玩Wakesurf騷纖腰</p><p>向來充滿青春活力的鍾柔美近日出海享受日光浴，她穿上藍白間條比堅尼上陣，激罕大曬纖細小蠻腰與白滑長腿。期間她被猛烈陽光曬到睜不開眼，擺出搞怪表情十分可愛；隨後更在烈日下大玩無繩滑水（Wakesurf），全程輕鬆駕馭滑板穿梭浪花，平衡力極佳兼姿勢滿分，獲大批網民激讚「又靚又識玩」。</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾柔美穿泳裝出海。（IG@yumichung1221）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190705043557715968650847.jpeg/_5-BJfQ6XVzLfuQ1oSBrIePSCzwgiL0ONuroiDbq6Ig\"/><figcaption>鍾柔美穿泳裝出海。（IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材好好！（IG@yumichung1221）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190705041124888576867435.jpeg/XxVfCsRmRCW62oMofkppDKLwFEsnYjnfjOS804zkvNM\"/><figcaption>身材好好！（IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷身材。（IG@yumichung1221）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190705038750781440560348.jpeg/z3vOLlifVXfjeb3fR6ViNIp3u7EiRyw5PYtJqD2LSag\"/><figcaption>大騷身材。（IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大玩滑水平衡力十足。（IG@yumichung1221）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190705036456366080214705.png/hev7DqdNHOB3dKLNphgaEj9HPP3dVvSFrNBgXKzQYFw\"/><figcaption>大玩滑水平衡力十足。（IG@yumichung1221）</figcaption></figure><p>炎明熹宣傳新歌玩遊戲聽錯「食屎」</p><p>至於同期出身的「樂壇小天后」炎明熹工作不斷，近日推出了全新單曲《在搖搖板上相對的我們》。日前她便找來MV男主角范麒智（Kenji）合體拍片，大玩網絡熱門的「不露齒挑戰」宣傳新歌。兩人在遊戲中要將嘴唇內縮並講出指定名詞，當挑戰「便利店有得賣嘅嘢」時，炎明熹吃力地將「腸仔」講成「強仔」；而當范麒智含糊吐出「栗子」時，炎明熹頓時滿頭問號，隨後更失控大笑指自己聽成了「食屎」，場面極度惹笑。</p><figure><img alt=\"炎明熹為谷新歌和MV男主角范麒智一齊玩遊戲。（IG@yiminghay）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190706486964391936967418.png/LOb0NTS7ae7V0rxVhOs2947wlt29VlgmfoqfBH6KnwQ\"/><figcaption>炎明熹為谷新歌和MV男主角范麒智一齊玩遊戲。（IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"將「栗子」聽錯成「食屎」。（IG@yiminghay）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190706484720308224251680.png/mut6Vr1ymbWUu3dwj9-Ogszu3sw8hSGRKuSAQCrkgEA\"/><figcaption>將「栗子」聽錯成「食屎」。（IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"將「栗子」聽錯成「食屎」。（IG@yiminghay）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190706481939353600042731.png/ILrjje30nx5fCN_pbGfMtr7KZNqZaADk_SPgO_0j4Ds\"/><figcaption>將「栗子」聽錯成「食屎」。（IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:15.894531+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":746,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:15:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T19:38:17.063322+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:37:01.549629+00:00","content_hash":"474a1502906373057c79d377b7837a66d425d32d97d2a32f437486df34b7861f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}